B.Ul=s(["Who, me? I didn't take anything... *hides acorn*","Your trash cans are *chef's kiss*","I regret nothing!","Oops, was that yours?","Finders keepers!"],t.s)
B.Rq=s(["Ooh, what's this shiny thing?","I wonder what's over there...","Have you ever tried eating a pinecone?","Tell me everything about this place!","*sniffs everything*"],t.s)
B.Sk=s(["Is there more food? Asking for a friend... me.","*munch munch munch*","I came for the buffet.","My belly is my compass.","Snacks? SNACKS!"],t.s)
B.SR=s(["Oh! You can see me?","*peeks from behind tail*","I'll just... sit here quietly...","Please don't tell anyone I was here.","Is it safe?"],t.s)
B.SG=s(["The night is young!","*yawns* Morning already?","Stars are extra sparkly tonight.","I do my best work after dark.","Moonlight becomes me."],t.s)
B.SS=s(["I climbed a mountain today! (It was a fence.)","Where's the next adventure?!","I've seen things you wouldn't believe!","Let's explore!","Danger is my middle name!"],t.s)
B.Sb=s(["Hey friend! Miss me?","The more the merrier!","I brought everyone!","Group hug? GROUP HUG!","You're my favorite human."],t.s)
B.U6=s(["*yaaaawn*","Zzz... huh? Oh, hi.","I'll do it tomorrow. Or the day after.","This spot is perfect for napping.","Moving is overrated."],t.s)
